      "category": "QueuedThreadPoolWrapper",
      "signature": "FQueuedThreadPoolWrapper(In Wrapped Queued Thread Pool, In Max Concurrency, In Priority Mapper)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "In Wrapped Queued Thread Pool",
          "type": "FQueuedThreadPool*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Max Concurrency",
          "type": "Int",
          "default": "-1"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Priority Mapper",
          "type": "TFunction<EQueuedWorkPriority ( EQueuedWorkPriority )>",
          "default": "DefaultQueuedWorkPriorityWrapper"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "public :",
      "docs": "ThreadPool wrapper implementation allowing to schedule\nup to MaxConcurrency tasks at a time making sub-partitioning\nanother thread-pool a breeze and allowing more fine-grained control\nover scheduling by effectively giving another set of priorities."
